{"4265320": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Bird Brigade", "steam_appid": 4265320, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Bird Brigade</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bird Brigade</strong> — a game about birds with multiplayer modes unusual for the genre. The most well-known is <strong>Nest mode</strong>, where one team defends its eggs while the other has to steal them and boil them in a cauldron. There are racing modes — <strong>Penguin Race</strong> and <strong>Rooster Race</strong> (a race of flightless birds) — plus the <strong>Exploration</strong> story mode: a procedurally generated open world with a <strong>campaign of 8 acts</strong>, quests, memorable NPCs and mini-games. On top of that: map rotation, a leveling system, a shop, friends and online play, and much more.<br><br>A full <strong>DNA system</strong> lets you assemble almost a billion unique birds — <strong>30+ bird presets</strong>, each species with its own stats and perks, and some with unique abilities. Get new birds in two ways: find eggs in vending machines and incubate them in nests — or have two birds <strong>collaborate</strong>, which produces a chick right away. <strong>Over 20 original soundtrack songs.</strong> A large number of skins adds variety. Gamepad supported. <strong>Cross-platform support is included.</strong></p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Bird Brigade</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bird Brigade</strong> — a game about birds with multiplayer modes unusual for the genre. The most well-known is <strong>Nest mode</strong>, where one team defends its eggs while the other has to steal them and boil them in a cauldron. There are racing modes — <strong>Penguin Race</strong> and <strong>Rooster Race</strong> (a race of flightless birds) — plus the <strong>Exploration</strong> story mode: a procedurally generated open world with a <strong>campaign of 8 acts</strong>, quests, memorable NPCs and mini-games. On top of that: map rotation, a leveling system, a shop, friends and online play, and much more.<br><br>A full <strong>DNA system</strong> lets you assemble almost a billion unique birds — <strong>30+ bird presets</strong>, each species with its own stats and perks, and some with unique abilities. Get new birds in two ways: find eggs in vending machines and incubate them in nests — or have two birds <strong>collaborate</strong>, which produces a chick right away. <strong>Over 20 original soundtrack songs.</strong> A large number of skins adds variety. Gamepad supported. <strong>Cross-platform support is included.</strong></p>", "short_description": "Become birds together with your friends! Defend your nests and steal your rivals' eggs, race as penguins and roosters, explore an open world in a story campaign, and collect unique birds with the DNA system.", "supported_languages": "English, Russian, German, Spanish - Spain", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4265320/0b8f9e291657dd4825e5098d1b9dc0fc0d7f4a60/header.jpg?t=1788058469", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4265320/63f26c668fbc7c2652f8f53075d49ae4766e53fe/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1788058469", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4265320/63f26c668fbc7c2652f8f53075d49ae4766e53fe/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1788058469", "website": "https://merkel.games/", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i3 4170<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 1024 MB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Nvidia GeForce GTX650<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 10<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 600 MB available 